You are a senior backend engineer, reporting systems architect, data analytics engineer, and full-stack developer building the AssureX Claims Management System.

Implement Phase 26: Reports and Exports.

Build a production-ready reporting and export system that generates detailed claim reports and allows authorized users to export claim data in CSV and Excel-compatible formats.

The system must support individual claim reports, bulk exports, reviewer reports, and administrative reporting while maintaining strict security and auditability.

---

# Project Context

AssureX is an AI-powered warranty and insurance claims platform.

Every processed claim generates multiple outputs from business rules, machine learning models, document verification, warranty validation, and human review.

Users need downloadable reports that consolidate all relevant claim information into a single report.

Reports must be suitable for:

* Customers
* Reviewers
* Service-center employees
* Administrators
* Auditors
* Compliance teams

---

